  "track.animation.m.testclock.co.limits": "Infinite animations do not run in ComposeTestRule and render their initial value. [[src:an-customize]]",
  "track.animation.m.testclock.co.x6": "Reducing motion for users is the app's job (bridge X6: WCAG 2.3.3 \"Animation from Interactions\", chapter E10); this site also has a \"Reduce motion\" button.",
