  "track.animation.m.vector.co.vectorize": "The `AnimationSpec` KDoc: the animation system operates on `AnimationVector`s; the spec describes how that vector should be animated. [[src:an-spec-src]]",
  "track.animation.m.vector.co.end.dp": "`tween()` defaults: 300 ms, delay 0, `FastOutSlowInEasing` = cubic-bezier (0.4, 0, 0.2, 1) at the pinned commit. [[src:an-spec-src]] [[src:an-easing-src]]",
