  "track.animation.m.exitlife.title": "When does content leave composition?",
  "track.animation.m.exitlife.overview": "A banner inside `AnimatedVisibility` is hidden (`visible` becomes false). Three versions: built-in effects only; an extra custom animation on the scope's `transition`; and an `animateFloatAsState` placed in the content. Watch how long the content stays in composition.",
  "track.animation.m.exitlife.wrapup": "Hiding does not mean removing at once: the content stays in composition throughout the exit effect, and is only removed and disposed when ALL enter/exit animations of its Transition are done, including custom ones created on the scope's `transition`. Animations outside that Transition (such as an `animate*AsState` in the content) are not waited for, so they can be cut off mid-way.",
  "track.animation.m.exitlife.simp.1": "The 150/300/500 ms marks are illustrative; the real duration of fadeOut/shrinkOut depends on the spec (a spring by default).",
  "track.animation.m.exitlife.ctl.hint": "Run all three and compare when the content is removed.",
